The photo shows a small paper bowl about 6-7 inches across, filled with whole almonds. I estimated about 25-30 almonds visible on top and roughly 40 in total, since the bowl looks fairly full. A whole almond weighs about 1.2 g, so 40 almonds would be about 48 g. The bowl looks fuller than that, so I raised the estimate to about 60 g, or roughly 50 almonds.

Almonds have about 5.8 kcal per gram, so 60 g comes to about 350 kcal.

